{"id":"0f4ff76187675015","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-split-coequalizer.md","title":"Definition — 反身平行对与分裂余等化子的绝对性","display":"Definition — 反身平行对与分裂余等化子的绝对性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-split-coequalizer","aliases":["14-df-split-coequalizer"],"display":"Definition — 反身平行对与分裂余等化子的绝对性","source_ref":"IV.4 Theorem 2 and final paragraph, printed 179–180; DjVu 95–96","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-morphism]]","[[14-df-functor]]","[[14-df-category]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-split-coequalizer"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-split-coequalizer</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 反身平行对与分裂余等化子的绝对性"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"IV.4 Theorem 2 and final paragraph, printed 179–180; DjVu 95–96"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5c5452002ba29fda\" href=\"?note=5c5452002ba29fda\" title=\"14-df-morphism\">14-df-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:P\\to Q\">\\(f,g:P\\to Q\\)</span> 是平行箭头，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:Q\\to R\">\\(q:Q\\to R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:R\\to Q\">\\(s:R\\to Q\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:Q\\to P\">\\(t:Q\\to P\\)</span> 为候选箭头。下标总是明确环境范畴。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H:\\mathcal A\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(H:\\mathcal A\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为任意函子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal A}(q,f,g)\\Longleftrightarrow\nq\\circ f=q\\circ g\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal A)\\\n\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(Q,X)\\\n(h\\circ f=h\\circ g\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists!v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(R,X)\\ (v\\circ q=h)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal A}(q,f,g)\\Longleftrightarrow\nq\\circ f=q\\circ g\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal A)\\\n\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(Q,X)\\\n(h\\circ f=h\\circ g\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists!v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(R,X)\\ (v\\circ q=h)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsReflexivePair}_{\\mathcal A}(f,g)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists i\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(Q,P)\\\n(f\\circ i=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal A}(Q)\\land g\\circ i=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal A}(Q)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsReflexivePair}_{\\mathcal A}(f,g)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists i\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(Q,P)\\\n(f\\circ i=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal A}(Q)\\land g\\circ i=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal A}(Q)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsSplitCoeq}_{\\mathcal A}(q,f,g,s,t)\\Longleftrightarrow\nq\\circ f=q\\circ g\\land q\\circ s=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal A}(R)\n\\land f\\circ t=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal A}(Q)\\land g\\circ t=s\\circ q.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsSplitCoeq}_{\\mathcal A}(q,f,g,s,t)\\Longleftrightarrow\nq\\circ f=q\\circ g\\land q\\circ s=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal A}(R)\n\\land f\\circ t=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal A}(Q)\\land g\\circ t=s\\circ q.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsSplitCoeq}_{\\mathcal A}(q,f,g,s,t)\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal A}(q,f,g).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsSplitCoeq}_{\\mathcal A}(q,f,g,s,t)\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal A}(q,f,g).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsSplitCoeq}_{\\mathcal A}(q,f,g,s,t)\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{IsSplitCoeq}_{\\mathcal B}(H(q),H(f),H(g),H(s),H(t))\n\\land\\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal B}(H(q),H(f),H(g)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsSplitCoeq}_{\\mathcal A}(q,f,g,s,t)\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{IsSplitCoeq}_{\\mathcal B}(H(q),H(f),H(g),H(s),H(t))\n\\land\\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal B}(H(q),H(f),H(g)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 IV.4 印刷179定义反身对，179–180使用 split coequalizer 并将定义指向 CWM。本条内建实际所需的四个分裂方程，给出完整证明，不以外书原子作依赖。分裂箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 不一定是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\">\\(f,g\\)</span> 的共同右逆，因此分裂余等化与反身对是两个不同条件。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"hf=hg\">\\(hf=hg\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v=hs\">\\(v=hs\\)</span>。利用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"sq=gt\">\\(sq=gt\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ft=1_Q\">\\(ft=1_Q\\)</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"vq=hsq=hgt=hft=h\">\\(vq=hsq=hgt=hft=h\\)</span>。若另有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wq=h\">\\(wq=h\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=wqs=hs=v\">\\(w=wqs=hs=v\\)</span>，故存在唯一。任意函子保持这四个箭头方程，因而像图仍分裂；再次应用刚才的计算，得到像图的余等化普遍性质。这就是“绝对性”：没有要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 保持一般余极限。所有输入箭头的源靶都在Hypothesis给定，未以裸方程替代类型。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"5c5452002ba29fda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"1f1269584b34ad4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"f,g:P\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"q:Q\\to R","display":false},{"tex":"s:R\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"t:Q\\to P","display":false},{"tex":"H:\\mathcal A\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal A}(q,f,g)\\Longleftrightarrow\nq\\circ f=q\\circ g\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal A)\\\n\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(Q,X)\\\n(h\\circ f=h\\circ g\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists!v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(R,X)\\ (v\\circ q=h)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsReflexivePair}_{\\mathcal A}(f,g)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists i\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(Q,P)\\\n(f\\circ i=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal A}(Q)\\land g\\circ i=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal A}(Q)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsSplitCoeq}_{\\mathcal A}(q,f,g,s,t)\\Longleftrightarrow\nq\\circ f=q\\circ g\\land q\\circ s=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal A}(R)\n\\land f\\circ t=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal A}(Q)\\land g\\circ t=s\\circ q.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsSplitCoeq}_{\\mathcal A}(q,f,g,s,t)\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal A}(q,f,g).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsSplitCoeq}_{\\mathcal A}(q,f,g,s,t)\\Longrightarrow\n\\operatorname{IsSplitCoeq}_{\\mathcal B}(H(q),H(f),H(g),H(s),H(t))\n\\land\\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal B}(H(q),H(f),H(g)).","display":true},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"f,g","display":false},{"tex":"hf=hg","display":false},{"tex":"v=hs","display":false},{"tex":"sq=gt","display":false},{"tex":"ft=1_Q","display":false},{"tex":"vq=hsq=hgt=hft=h","display":false},{"tex":"wq=h","display":false},{"tex":"w=wqs=hs=v","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false}],"bytes":2648,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-314","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-split-coequalizer|Definition — 反身平行对与分裂余等化子的绝对性]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-split-coequalizer]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-185","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-split-coequalizer]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-split-coequalizer]]"},{"id":"a847472bc37dd64a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-split-coequalizer]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-315","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-split-coequalizer|Definition — 反身平行对与分裂余等化子的绝对性]]"},{"id":"b6affdb837eb529f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f1b3afad9b25fc1d","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定代数 $K=(A,a)$。[[14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint]]定义 $q_K$ 为 $\\varepsilon_{FA},F(a)$ 的余等化，该对反身。保余等化假设使 $Gq_K:TA\\to GL_K$ 余等化 $\\mu_A,T(a)$。另一方面[[14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer]]与[[14-df-split-coequalizer]]证明 $a:TA\\to A$ 是同一对的分裂余等化。由两个余等化的泛性质，存在唯一互逆箭头 $i:A\\to GL_K$、$j:GL_K\\to A$ 满足 $ia=Gq_K$、$jGq_K=a$；两复合为恒等，因为余等化箭头右可消去。"},{"id":"ba35738413a412b8","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$m:A\\hookrightarrow E$ 为任意单态射。$B=E+E$，$i_0,i_1:E\\to B$ 为余积嵌入；$2=1+1$，$\\kappa_0,\\kappa_1:1\\to2$ 为余积嵌入。$q:B\\to Q$ 是 $i_0m,i_1m$ 的选定余等化子，采用 [[14-df-split-coequalizer]] 的 $\\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal E}(q,i_0m,i_1m)$。$s:Q\\to B$ 为候选截面，$\\operatorname{Im}$ 是像子对象。$t,d_2,D_2,C_s$ 为下式新构造；两个余积诱导箭头均用所选余积嵌入及存在唯一性定义。"},{"id":"4f584a450845e8d6","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本轮已将此路线使用的自由/遗忘伴随、比较函子、分裂余等化子和强 Beck 充分判据展开为 [[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]]、[[14-df-monadic-adjunction]]、[[14-df-split-coequalizer]]、[[14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer]]、[[14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint]]、[[14-thm-beck-monadicity]]。它们为该证明提供具体的单子工具；本条仍未展开 IV.5 幂对象反变函子的单子性与其所需余等化保持验证，不能仅凭新增的一般判据就宣称这条有限余极限证明已经完整重建。此段为证明路线导航，Assertion与直接定义依赖未变。"},{"id":"34c430417768f1a0","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$(T,\\eta,\\mu)$ 是 $\\mathcal C$ 上单子，$K=(A,a)$ 为 $T$ 代数。使用[[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]]的自由函子和[[14-df-monad-algebras]]的带标签箭头。余等化、反身对及分裂余等化的参数顺序见 [[14-df-split-coequalizer]]；这里的分裂数据在底层范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 中，不预设它们都是代数态射。"}],"outgoing":["5c5452002ba29fda","1f1269584b34ad4b","28211adc1b0ce5bc"]}